{{/*
The signature badge of a version of a change.
Template Attributes:
* . : asctrust.Badge (an empty Label draws nothing). Label is Verified, Unverified or Unsigned; Title explains it.
The state is in the text, so colour is never the only signal.
*/}}
{{if .Label}}<span class="rv-pill rv-pill-{{.Tone}} asc-sig" title="{{.Title}}" data-testid="asc-signature" data-state="{{.Label}}">{{if eq .Label "Verified"}}{{svg "octicon-verified" 12}} {{end}}{{.Label}}<span class="rv-sr">. {{.Title}}</span></span>{{end}}
